This folder contains R scripts used for the physical testing and dental morphology quantification components of this thesis, which includes methodological development and sensitivity analyses described in Chapter 4 and full work flows described in Chapter 5.

Scripts

  Chapter 4 Methods Development
  - Morphology Validation and Sensitivity includes the script for sensitivity and vaidation studies described in chapter 4.

  Chapter 5 Investigating Dental Form-Function Relationships
  - This includes the Full Dental Morphology Workflow for calculation of: tooth dimensions, intercuspal distances, cusp radius of curvature (RoC), cusp subtended angle (SA) and incisor CSA.
